  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction:  <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>The correct statement(s) in the balanced equation is/are<br/><br/>(1) Stiochiometric coefficient of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  is 6<br/><br/>(2) Iodide is oxidized <br/><br/>(3) Oxidation number of chlorine changes by 5 units <br/><br/>(4)  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  is one of the products"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "1, 2",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "1, 4",
      "is_correct": false
    },
